# At upkeep Tetravus exchanges two counters for two Tetravites, then reclaims them on a later upkeep (CR 607.2c, 118.12).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Tetravus
Island x30
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Tetravus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Decline
Bot1.PayCost(X: 2)
[T3 Bot1.Draw]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tetravus.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tetravus.Keywords = Flying
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tetravite Token#1.Toughness = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tetravite Token#1.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield = Tetravus; Tetravite Token; Tetravite Token
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.PayCost
Bot1.Choose(Tetravite Token#1; Tetravite Token#2)
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.Draw]
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Tetravus.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 3
Bot1.Battlefield = Tetravus
